{"kind":"doc","route":"/guide/deployment/diagnostics","title":"Deployment diagnostics","blocks":[{"t":"heading","level":1,"id":"deployment-diagnostics","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Deployment diagnostics"}]},{"t":"callout","tone":"warning","caption":"Experimental","children":[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Codes can be added, and their messages can change, between minor versions. Do"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"not match on a message in a CI script: match on the "},{"t":"code","text":"code"},{"t":"text","text":" field of the "},{"t":"code","text":"--json"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"report, which is the part meant to be stable."}]}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Every problem "},{"t":"code","text":"craft-ts check"},{"t":"text","text":" reports carries a code, the concerned runtime or"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"platform, a location, what is wrong and what to change. This page is the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"reference for the codes; it is verified against the checker, so a code cannot"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"ship undocumented."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"error"},{"t":"text","text":" fails the check and the command exits with "},{"t":"code","text":"1"},{"t":"text","text":". "},{"t":"code","text":"warning"},{"t":"text","text":" is printed"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"and the command still succeeds — warnings cover the heuristics, such as"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"scanning sources for environment variable reads, where a false positive must"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"not block a deployment."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Read a report with "},{"t":"code","text":"--json"},{"t":"text","text":" when a machine consumes it:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"npx","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craft-ts","kind":"string"},{