ant, is not offered by the provider."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Fix"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — Choose a provider that declares the capability, or change the runtime or the static mode."}]}]]},{"t":"heading","level":3,"id":"craft-deploy-provider-credentials-missing","children":[{"t":"code","text":"CRAFT_DEPLOY_PROVIDER_CREDENTIALS_MISSING"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The provider has no credentials."}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Cause"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — A credential the platform requires is absent from the environment. The tooling never stores one, so it can only report the name it expected."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Fix"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — Export the named variable in the shell or the CI secret store, then run the command again."}]}]]},{"t":"heading","level":3,"id":"craft-deploy-provider-invalid-module","children":[{"t":"code","text":"CRAFT_DEPLOY_PROVIDER_INVALID_MODULE"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The provider package does not export a provider."}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Cause"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — The module loaded but exposes no "},{"t":"code","text":"createCraftDeploymentProvider"},{"t":"text","text":" factory."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Fix"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — Export "},{"t":"code","text":"createCraftDeploymentProvider(options?)"},{"t":"text","text":" returning a "},{"t":"code","text":"CraftDeploymentProvider"},{"t":"text","text":"."}]}]]},{"t":"heading","level":3,"id":"craft-deploy-provider-not-installed","children":[{"t":"code","text":"CRAFT_DEPLOY_PROVIDER_NOT_INSTALLED"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The provider package is not installed."}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Cause"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — The CLI resolves a provider from "},{"t":"code","text":"@craft-ts/deploy-<name>"},{"t":"text","text":" at run time, and that package is absent from the project."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Fix"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — Install the provider package, or point "},{"t":"code","text":"--provider-module"},{"t":"text","text":" at the module that exports it."}]}]]},{"t":"heading","level":3,"id":"craft-deploy-provider-platform-unsupported","children":[{"t":"code","text":"CRAFT_DEPLOY_PROVIDER_PLATFORM_UNSUPPORTED"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The provider does not target this platform."}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Cause"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — The provider cannot deploy to the platform declared by the manifest."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Fix"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — Choose a provider that targets the platform, or change the platform."}]}]]},{"t":"heading","level":3,"id":"craft-deploy-provider-state-unavailable","children":[{"t":"code","text":"CRAFT_DEPLOY_PROVIDER_STATE_UNAVAILABLE"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The provider state cannot be read."}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Cause"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — An infrastructure provider reconciles against a recorded state; without it, a deployment cannot tell a creation from an update."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Fix"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — Make the state backend reachable, or initialise it for this stage before deploying."}]}]]},{"t":"heading","level":3,"id":"craft-deploy-provider-toolchain-missing","children":[{"t":"code","text":"CRAFT_DEPLOY_PROVIDER_TOOLCHAIN_MISSING"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"A tool the provider drives is missing."}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Cause"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — The provider shells out to a CLI or imports a runtime package that is not installed."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Fix"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — Install the reported tool, or choose a provider that does not need it."}]}]]},{"t":"heading","level":3,"id":"craft-deploy-provider-unknown","children":[{"t":"code","text":"CRAFT_DEPLOY_PROVIDER_UNKNOWN"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Unknown provider."}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Cause"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — The provider name is absent from the capability matrix."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Fix"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — Use a documented provider name, or register the provider before checking."}]}]]},{"t":"heading","level":3,"id":"craft-deploy-provider-unsupported-resource","children":[{"t":"code","text":"CRAFT_DEPLOY_PROVIDER_UNSUPPORTED_RESOURCE"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The provider has no resource for this part of the manifest."}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Cause"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — The runtime, the platform or a declared binding maps to nothing the provider knows how to create."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Fix"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — Remove the declaration, or deploy that part with a provider that supports it."}]}]]},{"t":"heading","level":3,"id":"craft-deploy-ready-path-missing","children":[{"t":"code","text":"CRAFT_DEPLOY_READY_PATH_MISSING"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The readiness route is not served by the SSR entry."}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Cause"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — The path declared as "},{"t":"code","text":"server.readyPath"},{"t":"text","text":" was not found in the module graph of the SSR entry."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Fix"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — Serve the declared path, or align the manifest with the path the server exposes."}]}]]},{"t":"heading","level":3,"id":"craft-deploy-runtime-mismatch","children":[{"t":"code","text":"CRAFT_DEPLOY_RUNTIME_MISMATCH"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The requested runtime is not the manifest runtime."}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Cause"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — "},{"t":"code","text":"--runtime"},{"t":"text","text":" was passed with a value the manifest does not declare."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Fix"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — Drop the flag, or change "},{"t":"code","text":"runtime"},{"t":"text","text":" in the manifest."}]}]]},{"t":"heading","level":3,"id":"craft-deploy-runtime-platform-incompatible","children":[{"t":"code","text":"CRAFT_DEPLOY_RUNTIME_PLATFORM_INCOMPATIBLE"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"This platform cannot execute this runtime."}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Cause"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — The platform has no execution shape for the declared runtime, for instance a "},{"t":"code","text":"lambda"},{"t":"text","text":" runtime on Cloudflare."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Fix"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — Change the runtime or the platform; the compatibility matrix lists the supported pairs."}]}]]},{"t":"heading","level":3,"id":"craft-deploy-spa-fallback-missing","children":[{"t":"code","text":"CRAFT_DEPLOY_SPA_FALLBACK_MISSING"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The SPA fallback document is missing from the client output."}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Cause"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — A "},{"t":"code","text":"spa"},{"t":"text","text":" deployment answers unknown paths with the fallback document, which is absent from the built output."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Fix"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — Build the client, or correct "},{"t":"code","text":"static.fallback"},{"t":"text","text":"."}]}]]},{"t":"heading","level":3,"id":"craft-deploy-ssg-routes-missing","children":[{"t":"code","text":"CRAFT_DEPLOY_SSG_ROUTES_MISSING"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The SSG mode declares no route."}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Cause"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — A "},{"t":"code","text":"ssg"},{"t":"text","text":" deployment pre-renders one HTML file per route and the route list is empty."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Fix"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — List the routes in "},{"t":"code","text":"static.routes"},{"t":"text","text":", or switch the mode to "},{"t":"code","text":"spa"},{"t":"text","text":"."}]}]]},{"t":"heading","level":3,"id":"craft-deploy-ssg-route-not-rendered","children":[{"t":"code","text":"CRAFT_DEPLOY_SSG_ROUTE_NOT_RENDERED"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"A declared SSG route has no pre-rendered document."}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Cause"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — The artefact contains neither "},{"t":"code","text":"<route>.html"},{"t":"text","text":" nor "},{"t":"code","text":"<route>/index.html"},{"t":"text","text":" for a route listed in "},{"t":"code","text":"static.routes"},{"t":"text","text":"."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Fix"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — Run the pre-render step for that route, or remove it from "},{"t":"code","text":"static.routes"},{"t":"text","text":"."}]}]]},{"t":"heading","level":3,"id":"craft-deploy-ssg-route-not-static","children":[{"t":"code","text":"CRAFT_DEPLOY_SSG_ROUTE_NOT_STATIC"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"An SSG route cannot be pre-rendered."}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Cause"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — The route is not an absolute literal path: it carries a "},{"t":"code","text":":param"},{"t":"text","text":", a wildcard or a query string, so no single HTML file represents it."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Fix"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — Expand the route into its literal paths, or declare it in "},{"t":"code","text":"static.serverRoutes"},{"t":"text","text":"."}]}]]}],"outline":[{"lev